		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ab146d1 col-not-grid e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="ab146d1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5a705cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-breadcrumbs" data-id="5a705cf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="breadcrumbs.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<p id="breadcrumbs"><span><span><a href="https://valleywisehealth.org/">Home</a></span> <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/themes/hello-theme-child-master/images/chevron-rigth.svg"> <span><a href="https://valleywisehealth.org/about/">About Valleywise Health</a></span> <img decoding="async" src="/wp-content/themes/hello-theme-child-master/images/chevron-rigth.svg"> <span class="breadcrumb_last" aria-current="page">Our Board of Directors</span></span></p>				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-df12534 texto-link elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="df12534" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c828324 lead-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c828324" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The Maricopa County Special Health Care District Board is seeking applicants to represent District 3, which serves the cities of Anthem, Cave Creek, Desert Hills, New River, Paradise Valley, and Phoenix. The due date for submitting completed applications is: <strong>April 9th, 2026</strong>.</p><p>Inquiries can be sent to: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#92d6fbe1e6e0fbf1e6d1fef7e0f9e1d2e4f3fefef7ebe5fbe1f7faf7f3fee6fabcfde0f5" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="db9fb2a8afa9b2b8aff598b7bea9b0a89badbab7b7bea2acb2a8beb3bebab7afb3f5b4a9bc">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-22f23a6 wpb-buttons-wrapper e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="22f23a6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6fc2ffc wpb-text-link elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="6fc2ffc" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://valleywisehealth.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Board-Vacancy-Notice-2026.pdf" target="_blank">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Download the Vacancy Notice</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-23b5179 wpb-text-link elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="23b5179" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/pdf/Candidate_application_fillable.pdf" target="_blank">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Download the Fillable Candidate Application</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
