				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b085938 texto-link e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="b085938" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-319a7d6 lead-text elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="319a7d6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>The Maricopa County Special Health Care District Board of Directors is the governing body for Valleywise Health. Each Board member represents one of the five districts in Maricopa County. Members of the District Board are elected by voters of Maricopa County and serve a four-year term.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b5c8ce1 wpb-buttons-wrapper e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="b5c8ce1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
